      "cooked": "<p>I’m unable to delete a customized card in my workspace. Every time I remove it and save, it says no changes have been made. Then, when I refresh, the card reappears.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f562270009d8fc20b1eee00ed11bda1e9d07ac6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/1f562270009d8fc20b1eee00ed11bda1e9d07ac6\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.33.25 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f562270009d8fc20b1eee00ed11bda1e9d07ac6_2_690x111.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.33.25 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"4tdlk7Lx8JeSUOySKtRVhmxK3JQ\" width=\"690\" height=\"111\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f562270009d8fc20b1eee00ed11bda1e9d07ac6_2_690x111.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/1/f/1f562270009d8fc20b1eee00ed11bda1e9d07ac6_2_1035x166.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/1/f/1f562270009d8fc20b1eee00ed11bda1e9d07ac6.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FDFDFD\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.33.25 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1190×192 5.06 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/5/a/5a89018904d14292e86892c947bb1e1f90f5c1a4.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.33.51 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"cUUvolR6Bd4wCGqlQChS9Qsb7yA\" width=\"510\" height=\"110\"></p>\n<p>I’ve reviewed the doctype and confirmed that the card is no longer in the “Home” workspace, yet it still continues to appear.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/f/7fab1ae9b9be2937a107d542d416b1694bfaddba.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7fab1ae9b9be2937a107d542d416b1694bfaddba\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.34.57 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/f/7fab1ae9b9be2937a107d542d416b1694bfaddba_2_690x348.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.34.57 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"idpefkz7Bg2Gre2iZzZMeJigBQe\" width=\"690\" height=\"348\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/f/7fab1ae9b9be2937a107d542d416b1694bfaddba_2_690x348.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/f/7fab1ae9b9be2937a107d542d416b1694bfaddba_2_1035x522.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/f/7fab1ae9b9be2937a107d542d416b1694bfaddba.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F9F9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.34.57 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1068×540 53.9 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>I checked backend &amp; same issue. It’s not on DB<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/7/77779955c722c87f9dd26f5fdd9eb967b796faaa.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/77779955c722c87f9dd26f5fdd9eb967b796faaa\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.35.34 PM\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/7/77779955c722c87f9dd26f5fdd9eb967b796faaa_2_562x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.35.34 PM\" data-base62-sha1=\"h2R3DcjimFNjSV6RKSk4f1MdbWW\" width=\"562\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/7/77779955c722c87f9dd26f5fdd9eb967b796faaa_2_562x500.jpeg, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/7/77779955c722c87f9dd26f5fdd9eb967b796faaa_2_843x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/7/77779955c722c87f9dd26f5fdd9eb967b796faaa_2_1124x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"070707\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot 2025-02-24 at 6.35.34 PM</span><span class=\"informations\">1568×1394 151 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Have any one you encountered this &amp; are there any possible solution?</p>\n<p>Thanks in advance.</p>",
